Replace the two separate panels (Lessons panel + Monsters panel) with a single interleaved timeline. Each step shows a lesson card followed immediately by its paired monster card.

In the @code block:
- Keep loading _lessons and _monsters as before
- Add a record: `private record ZoneStep(Lesson Lesson, bool LessonDone, bool LessonLocked, MonsterStatus? Monster);`
- Build _steps list after loading both:
```csharp
_steps = _lessons.OrderBy(l => l.OrderNumber).Select((lesson, i) => {
