## CHANGE 7 — Components/Pages/BattlePage.razor: on victory show next lesson link

Read the victory screen section. Currently it shows a 'Back to Zone' button.

Load the next lesson after battle is won. In the victory section, load what comes next:
```csharp
// After a Won battle, find the next lesson (the lesson after the one paired with this challenge)
private Lesson? _nextLesson;

// In OnInitializedAsync or after SubmitAnswer sets Status=Won:
if (_battle?.Status == BattleStatus.Won && _challenge != null)
{
    // Find the lesson AFTER the one paired with this challenge (by OrderNumber)
    var currentLesson = _challenge.LessonId.HasValue
        ? await Db.Lessons.FindAsync(_challenge.LessonId.Value)
        : null;
    if (currentLesson != null)
    {
        _nextLesson = await Db.Lessons
            .Where(l => l.ZoneId == _challenge.ZoneId
                     && l.OrderNumber > currentLesson.OrderNumber)
            .OrderBy(l => l.OrderNumber)
            .FirstOrDefaultAsync();
    }
}
```

